 portfolio of services, strong commitment to sustainability and good corporate citizenship, we have over 175,000 dedicated employees serving clients across six continents. Together, we discover ideas and connect the dots to build a better and a bold new future.&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n',_binary '‰PNG\r\n\Z\n\0\0\0\rIHDR\0\0\0X\0\0\0F\0\0\0HIS\ß\0\0%iTXtXML:com.adobe.xmp\0\0\0\0\0<?xpacket begin=\"ï»¿\" id=\"W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d\"?>\n<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x=\"adobe:ns:meta/\" x:xmptk=\"Adobe XMP Core 5.5-c021 79.153613, 2013/07/11-05:21:54        \">\n <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\">\n  <rdf:Description rdf:about=\"\"\n    xmlns:ns1=\"http://www.day.com/dam/1.0\"\n    xmlns:tiff=\"http://ns.adobe.com/tiff/1.0/\"\n    xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n   ns1:Physicalheightininches=\"-1.0\"\n   ns1:Physicalwidthininches=\"-1.0\"\n   ns1:Fileformat=\"PNG\"\n   ns1:Progressive=\"no\"\n   ns1:extracted=\"2018-06-19T12:29:52.267+05:30\"\n   ns1:Bitsperpixel=\"32\"\n   ns1:MIMEtype=\"image/png\"\n   ns1:Comments=\"Software: Adobe ImageReady&#xA;\"\n   ns1:Physicalwidthindpi=\"-1\"\n   ns1:Physicalheightindpi=\"-1\"\n   ns1:Numberofimages=\"1\"\n   ns1:Numberoftextualcomments=\"1\"\n   ns1:sha1=\"c71a2248f2b73f02584d7f808d2072241a82ad04\"\n   ns1:size=\"6109\"\n   tiff:ImageLength=\"70\"\n   tiff:ImageWidth=\"88\"\n   dc:format=\"image/png\"\n   dc:modified=\"2018-06-19T12:30:01.729+05:30\"/>\n </rdf:RDF>\n</x:xmpmeta>\n<?xpacket end=\"r\"?>RƒMX\0\0\0tEXtSoftware\0Adobe ImageReadyq\Ée<\0\0IDATx\Ú\ì\\\r”U½¿÷\Îd³»İ–©ú|\à\Î\Ê\ãÁ\Ó\ã!«G¥tR,Eš´T(OÙ¤\Ğpwe7ò!GÁd”–J“}\å\ÕZ>’j\Ñ^I\n¢P7Ÿ<õ=\İ)\ê\Ów<²Si÷#™¹÷ı\ï\Í$™d“tw»\Äm\Ós›Ù™É;¿û¿¿ÿ\ïÿ¿w‚\ÑI°»ù\é\0F8Ša#’&Œøºöb½üº%‘~\r®I?\Ùy®Q¯¶\áÁm{sÍ—XjAR\×\áUtşT\Û\æ¨\ãA\0U<\áÿ¨”øÉº…şü5‹{_ñ†\ãp^\å\×0\Æ\"Ou}¼«M\'3\Ü\è·\Ñn(\ZCL›H¾k\ëv\Åa\"j³Qœ2¨>\ÄuŒ‰\Òy\Åı=Xl€¡\0\ZÀ‹)²S