 style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n<div class=\"justifytext\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify;\">\r\n<div class=\"innerpage\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><span style=\"font-family:akkurat; font-size:18px !important\">The Spirit of Wipro is the core of Wipro. These are our Values.&nbsp;It is about who we are. It is&nbsp;our character. It is reflected consistently in all our behavior.&nbsp;The Spirit is deeply rooted in the unchanging essence of Wipro. But it also embraces what we must aspire to be.&nbsp;It is the indivisible synthesis of the four values. The Spirit is a beacon. It is what gives us direction and a clear sense of purpose. It energizes us and is the touchstone for all that we do.</span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n','1000000','www.wipro.com','www.linked.com','www.twiter.com','www.Glassdoor.com','www.facebook.com\\Wipro','indrajeet');
